I made you a [little night garden](night-garden.html).

Open it in a browser and click to plant softly glowing flowers beneath a crescent moon. There are drifting fireflies, an undo button, and **Keep a picture** to save your garden as a PNG.

One file. No dependencies, network requests, or score to chase.

Keyboard controls and reduced-motion support included. Script checks passed; I haven’t visually tested it in a browser.
